"""
BrandPulse AI — Twitter Sentiment Analysis Dashboard
=====================================================
Persevex NLP Internship Project
Converted from Streamlit to Plotly Dash for enhanced interactivity and modern SaaS UI.

Features:
---------
1. Predict            Single-tweet prediction with per-class probability bars.
2. Batch Analysis     CSV upload → distribution, confidence, word cloud, download.
3. Live Stream        Simulated incoming-tweet feed + 24h sentiment trend.
4. Model Comparison   Logistic Regression vs BiLSTM metrics, charts, confusion matrix.
5. Error Analysis     Misclassified examples, most-confused class pairs, limitations.
6. About              Dataset stats, pipeline diagram, methodology, model recommendation.

Run:
    python app.py

Then open http://127.0.0.1:8050 in your browser.
"""

